3. Third-party data and results
-------------------------------

This software implements models published by others. If you use it in a
publication, cite the model papers alongside the MARTINI papers — see the
"Credits and citation" section of README.md, and CITATION.cff.

The HI/H2 prescriptions in astrovodka/himodel are implementations of:

  - Gnedin, N. Y. & Draine, B. T. 2014, ApJ, 795, 37
  - Krumholz, M. R., McKee, C. F. & Tumlinson, J. 2013, ApJ, 771, 36
  - Diemer, B., Stevens, A. R. H., Forbes, J. C., et al. 2018, ApJS, 238, 33
    (the reference implementation these were verified against)
  - Faucher-Giguère, C.-A., Kereš, D., Ma, C.-P., et al. 2011, MNRAS, 415, 3237
    (the UV background used as a floor)


